WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.480
 Oh, hello weary traveller. Would you like to come in and take a break from your travels?

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:11.760
 It looks like you're rather fatigued.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:21.420
 Hmm. Come in, come in. Come on. Come, sit down. Sit.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:35.000
 Good. Don't mind my cat's mittens. Fluffy, Sparky, and Jack. They'll just kind of be on their own in the corner there. They're a little bit hungry right now, but don't mind them.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
 So, I want to take care of you right now. Mittens, please.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:52.000
 Yeah, sorry about that. When you live in the woods like this, it gets pretty lonely sometimes. So, I collect cats to keep me company.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:09.060
 I hope you don't mind them. They seem to like you. They're kind of curious, and they seem to be trying to talk to you. Look at them down by your feet.

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:17.240
 I think Jack really likes you. He's practically crawling up here.

00:01:18.880 --> 00:01:22.260
 Well, you look like you're pretty tired and exhausted.

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:27.320
 So, why don't you try some of my new potion that I have?

00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:33.220
 I've been working on it for a while now, and I put lots of love and care into it.

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:40.900
 It's supposed to make you feel invigorated, and it brings back all of the energy that you've lost.

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:45.440
 and especially any vital nutrients that you're in need of right now.

00:01:46.140 --> 00:01:50.460
 You look like you're probably dehydrated and probably malnourished.

00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:56.940
 So, this potion will recover all of the lost vitamins and minerals in your body

00:01:56.940 --> 00:02:01.180
 and also just give you that extra boost that you need to carry on.

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:04.780
 You are so lucky you came by here today.

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:10.720
 You know, if I wasn't here, I don't know how much farther you would have gone.

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:15.220
 You look just simply exhausted

00:02:15.220 --> 00:02:18.580
 Look at that

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:21.020
 You look so tired

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:28.100
 Well, my potion will be perfect for you

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:30.100
 Absolutely

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:32.400
 Perfect

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:38.620
 Alright, why don't we give it a try?

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:41.660
 First, I need to shake it up a little bit.

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:02.660
 Gotta get it all activated and ready.

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:32.540
 Perfect. So for this type of potion we have a dropper.

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:46.540
 to have two drops under the tongue. It's very simple. It's not the most delicious thing ever,

00:03:46.540 --> 00:04:00.540
 but the taste will be easily washed away with some water. So, if you want, I can get you

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:03.540
 or you can just breathe it

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:32.740
 Do you think you can handle it on your own?

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:37.640
 I'll be right here so you don't have to worry

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:41.640
 Don't be afraid

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:47.140
 I've tested this potion many times and it definitely works

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:51.340
 It does exactly what it's supposed to do

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:29.520
 So, let's go.

00:05:29.540 --> 00:05:53.540
 All right. So I've got a vial full here and I'll just open your mouth. Say, ah. Like that. Good. Stick out your tongue. And I'll just put the dropper right underneath your tongue like this. And drop.

00:05:57.540 --> 00:06:03.540
 There we go. Sorry, it does taste a little bit bitter doesn't it?

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:09.540
 Just swallow it up and let it start to work its magic on you.

00:06:12.540 --> 00:06:15.540
 Look at that.

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:20.540
 Do you feel any better?

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:30.440
 It should make you feel delightful, make you feel happy and cute, fuzzy like a kin.

00:06:34.840 --> 00:06:40.920
 Do you notice any changes in your body?

00:06:42.760 --> 00:06:47.040
 You should be starting to feel the changes.

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:54.000
 It looks like you're growing a little bit of facial hair.

00:06:56.920 --> 00:07:01.220
 Have you ever noticed that your face is rather fuzzy?

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:12.280
 It looks like maybe you're getting a little fuzzy over there in your face.

00:07:12.840 --> 00:07:14.960
 Oh, and your hands too.

