 Wow. Your hands are becoming more and more fluffy. Just look at them. Soft little hands. Oh, and look, you've got beans on each finger.

00:07:37.800 --> 00:07:41.800
 Little fleshy toebeats.

00:07:41.800 --> 00:07:43.800
 So cute.

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:51.800
 Looks like your body is becoming smaller and smaller.

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:58.800
 Don't worry, this is how the potion works.

00:07:58.800 --> 00:08:00.800
 There, there.

00:08:01.800 --> 00:08:05.800
 You're becoming small like a little cat.

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:19.640
 Let's see your teeth, here. That's working fine, yet your teeth have become sharp,

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:26.200
 little canines. So cute.

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:34.280
 Look at that. You've got little cat ears coming through your head

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:38.920
 and your regular ears have disappeared

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:48.040
 you feel at ease, don't you?

00:08:49.160 --> 00:08:51.240
 you feel safe and comfortable here

00:08:53.560 --> 00:08:57.720
 the potion is making you feel much better, isn't it?

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:04.760
 oh and look at the long tail that's beginning to emerge from behind you

