 So beautiful. It's fluffy. What a gorgeous tail you have. Your little paws have become fully formed. Look at that little face.

00:09:27.280 --> 00:09:30.880
 Your face is now smaller and buffier

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:36.880
 You are my little kitty

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:39.280
 Look at you

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:44.880
 It's okay, little kitty

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:47.280
 It's okay

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:50.480
 You're trying to speak

00:09:51.280 --> 00:09:53.280
 You can only meow now

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:56.880
 It's okay, you don't need to speak

