 They really like tuna fish. Don't worry, I have lots to go around and you can share it with everybody.

00:10:32.600 --> 00:10:41.200
 And we have a litter box that is coed and communal.

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:46.200
 Be fine, you'll just fit right in.

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:58.100
 Don't worry. There, there, little kitty. You're gonna be just fine. Don't you feel much happier

00:10:58.100 --> 00:11:11.200
 now? You know, cats are way better than humans. That's why I collect them. Of course we have

00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:19.680
 my doll collection as well, but the cats are a little more interactive for me. I find that

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:31.040
 cats, they just give you a really nice company and I get really lonely when my dolls can't

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:43.360
 talk to me, but my cats, they can meow, meow, meow, meow, and they can purr, purr, purr,

00:11:43.360 --> 00:11:51.600
 purr, and they can say hello to me whenever I come home, and they always look forward

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:57.600
 A cat seems to love you no matter what, as long as you have food to give it.

00:11:57.600 --> 00:12:05.600
 And don't worry, you're an indoor cat, so you won't be going outside or trying to get away.

00:12:05.600 --> 00:12:13.600
 You're going to stay right by my side as my little kitty.

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:32.500
 Oh, you're purring. You can't help but enjoy the feeling, can't you?

00:12:32.500 --> 00:12:39.400
 I knew you'd fit right in here. I knew this was the place for you.

00:12:39.400 --> 00:13:03.400
 Your fur is grey and fluffy. You look so small and helpless. You're so soft. The way you

00:13:03.400 --> 00:13:06.400
 It makes me feel very happy inside.

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:14.400
 You're a good kitty?

00:13:14.400 --> 00:13:16.400
 Yes, you are.

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:19.400
 Maybe I'll get you some treats later.

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:23.400
 I've got lots of kitty treats.

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:26.400
 Lots of food.

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:30.400
 If you're really good, you'll get some people food.

00:13:30.400 --> 00:13:32.400
 Wouldn't you like that?

00:13:33.400 --> 00:13:42.140
 And of course every night, you'll crawl into my lap, and I'll pet you while you purr just like this.

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:51.620
 And mittens, and sparky, and jag, and fluffers, they'll join as well.

00:13:52.620 --> 00:13:57.240
 They really love the new company.

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:02.440
 They get quite excited and riled up when someone new joins the crew.

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:09.400
 I think you'll find yourself very comfortable here

00:14:21.400 --> 00:14:23.400
 That's good

00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:25.400
 Good kid, good, good, good

00:14:25.400 --> 00:14:29.400
 Your life will be so much better than it was before

00:14:29.400 --> 00:14:54.400
 Back when you were a traveler, you just wandered and didn't really have a purpose and you tried to find purpose wherever you could and you went days and days without water and food, but now you're safe and you're taken care of and you've got all the food you could ever need.

00:14:54.400 --> 00:15:00.400
 So don't worry, your life here will be much, much better.

